  "prefLabel": "We 101.11 Critical well location",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 101.11 “Critical well location” means an actual or proposed well location delineated on state approved plans and specifications, pursuant to RSA 485-A:30-b, with a conditional approval requiring the location not be moved, usually a result of lot loading requirements.\n\nSource. #12075, eff 12-24-16",
